       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. sum.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 WS-INP1-VAL PIC 99 VALUE 0.
        01 WS-QUO PIC 99 VALUE 0.
        01 WS-REM PIC 99 VALUE 0.
      * WS-INP2-VAL PIC 9 VALUE 0.
        
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
            DISPLAY "Hello World".
            ACCEPT WS-INP1-VAL.
            DIVIDE WS-INP1-VAL BY 2 GIVING WS-QUO REMAINDER WS-REM
            
            IF (WS-REM EQUALS ZEROS)
               DISPLAY "NUM IS EVEN"
            ELSE
               DISPLAY "NUM IS ODD".
            STOP RUN.
